:7},{"id":"std/Io/Semaphore.zig:9:12337","name":"std.Io.Semaphore.testing","anchor":"std.Io.Semaphore.testing","category":"alias","sourceLine":9},{"id":"std/Io/Semaphore.zig:22:12338","name":"std.Io.Semaphore.wait","anchor":"std.Io.Semaphore.wait","category":"function","sourceLine":22},{"id":"std/Io/Semaphore.zig:38:12340","name":"std.Io.Semaphore.waitTimeout","anchor":"std.Io.Semaphore.waitTimeout","category":"function","sourceLine":38},{"id":"std/Io/Semaphore.zig:29:12339","name":"std.Io.Semaphore.WaitTimeoutError","anchor":"std.Io.Semaphore.WaitTimeoutError","category":"error-set","sourceLine":29},{"id":"std/Io/Semaphore.zig:52:12341","name":"std.Io.Semaphore.waitUncancelable","anchor":"std.Io.Semaphore.waitUncancelable","category":"function","sourceLine":52},{"id":"std/Io/Semaphore.zig:76:12343","name":"std.Io.Semaphore.worker","anchor":"std.Io.Semaphore.worker","category":"function","sourceLine":76},{"id":"std/Io/Semaphore.zig:103:12344","name":"std.Io.Semaphore.worker","anchor":"std.Io.Semaphore.worker--L103","category":"function","sourceLine":103},{"id":"std/Io/Semaphore.zig:141:12345","name":"std.Io.Semaphore.worker","anchor":"std.Io.Semaphore.worker--L141","category":"function","sourceLine":141}],"html":"<div id=\"std.Io.Semaphore\"></div>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L1\">第 1 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>无符号整数；若操作将使数值\n变为负数，则阻塞内核线程。</p>\n<p>此接口支持静态初始化，不需要反初始化。</p>\n</div>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>mutex: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io.Mutex\">Mutex</a> = .init</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>cond: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io.Condition\">Condition</a> = .init</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>permits: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>此字段可以安全地初始化为任意值。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"api-members\"><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore\"><code>Semaphore</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\"><code>std</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\"><code>Io</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing\"><code>testing</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore.wait\"><code>wait</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore.WaitTimeoutError\"><code>WaitTimeoutError</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore.waitTimeout\"><code>waitTimeout</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore.waitUncancelable\"><code>waitUncancelable</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore.post\"><code>post</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore.worker\"><code>worker</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#std.Io.Semaphore.worker--L103\"><code>worker</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#std.Io.Semaphore.worker--L141\"><code>worker</code></a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Io.Semaphore.Io\"><h3><code>std.Io.Semaphore.Io</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L8\">第 8 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\"><code>std.Io</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Io.Semaphore.post\"><h3><code>std.Io.Semaphore.post</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L61\">第 61 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>使额外一个 <code>permit</code> 可用。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">post</span>(s: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore\">Semaphore</a>, io: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>s: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore\">Semaphore</a></code></pre>\n<pre><code>io: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Io.Semaphore.Semaphore\"><h3><code>std.Io.Semaphore.Semaphore</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L5\">第 5 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore\"><code>std.Io.Semaphore</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Io.Semaphore.std\"><h3><code>std.Io.Semaphore.std</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L7\">第 7 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\"><code>std</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Io.Semaphore.testing\"><h3><code>std.Io.Semaphore.testing</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L9\">第 9 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing\"><code>std.testing</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Io.Semaphore.wait\"><h3><code>std.Io.Semaphore.wait</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L22\">第 22 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>阻塞直到 <code>permit</code> 可用，并消耗一个许可。\n取消时解除阻塞，但不消耗 <code>permit</code>。</p>\n<p>另见：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore.waitTimeout\">waitTimeout</a></code></li>\n<li><code><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore.waitUncancelable\">waitUncancelable</a></code></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">wait</span>(s: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore\">Semaphore</a>, io: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>) <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io.Cancelable\">Cancelable</a>!<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>s: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore\">Semaphore</a></code></pre>\n<pre><code>io: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h4>错误</h4><dl>\n<dt>Canceled</dt><dd><p>调用方请求停止异步操作。</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<h4>用法示例</h4><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> wait {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> io = <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing\">testing</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.io\">io</a>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Context = <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span> {\n        sem: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore\">Semaphore</a> = .{ .permits = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> },\n        n: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>,\n\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">worker</span>(ctx: *<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@This</span>()) !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> ctx.sem.wait(io);\n            ctx.n += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n            ctx.sem.post(io);\n        }\n    };\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> ctx: Context = .{};\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> group: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io.Group\">Group</a> = .init;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">defer</span> group.cancel(io);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> num_workers = <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..num_workers) |_| group.async(io, Context.worker, .{&amp;ctx});\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> group.await(io);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing\">testing</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expectEqual\">expectEqual</a>(num_workers, ctx.n);\n}</code></pre>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Io.Semaphore.waitTimeout\"><h3><code>std.Io.Semaphore.waitTimeout</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L38\">第 38 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>阻塞直到 <code>permit</code> 可用，并消费一个。\n若被取消，或所给超时在 <code>permit</code> 可用前\n到期，则解除阻塞，但不消费 <code>permit</code>。</p>\n<p>另请参见：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore.wait\">wait</a></code></li>\n<li><code><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore.waitUncancelable\">waitUncancelable</a></code></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">waitTimeout</span>(s: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore\">Semaphore</a>, io: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>, timeout: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io.Timeout\">Timeout</a>) <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore.WaitTimeoutError\">WaitTimeoutError</a>!<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>s: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore\">Semaphore</a></code></pre>\n<pre><code>io: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a></code></pre>\n<pre><code>timeout: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io.Timeout\">Timeout</a></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h4>错误</h4><dl>\n<dt>Canceled <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io.Cancelable\">Cancelable</a></dt><dd><p>调用方请求停止异步操作。</p>\n</dd>\n<dt>Timeout <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io.Timeout.Error\">Error</a></dt><dd></dd>\n</dl>\n<h4>用法示例</h4><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> waitTimeout {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> io = <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing\">testing</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.io\">io</a>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Context = <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span> {\n        ready: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io.Event\">Event</a> = .unset,\n        sem: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore\">Semaphore</a> = .{ .permits = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span> },\n        value: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>,\n\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">worker</span>(ctx: *<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@This</span>()) !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">defer</span> ctx.ready.set(io);\n\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing\">testing</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expectError\">expectError</a>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.Timeout, ctx.sem.waitTimeout(io, .{ .duration = .{\n                .raw = .fromMilliseconds(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>),\n                .clock = .awake,\n            } }));\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing\">testing</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expectEqual\">expectEqual</a>(<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>, ctx.value);\n\n            ctx.ready.set(io);\n\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (ctx.value == <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> ctx.sem.wait(io);\n            <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing\">testing</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expectEqual\">expectEqual</a>(<span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>, ctx.value);\n        }\n    };\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> ctx: Context = .{};\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> future = io.concurrent(Context.worker, .{&amp;ctx}) <span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span> |err| <span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span> (err) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.ConcurrencyUnavailable =&gt; <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">error</span>.SkipZigTest,\n    };\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">defer</span> future.cancel(io) <span class=\"tok-kw\">catch</span> {};\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> ctx.ready.wait(io);\n\n    ctx.value = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    ctx.sem.post(io);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> future.await(io);\n}</code></pre>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Io.Semaphore.WaitTimeoutError\"><h3><code>std.Io.Semaphore.WaitTimeoutError</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">错误集合</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L29\">第 29 行</a></p>\n<h4>错误</h4><dl>\n<dt>Canceled <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io.Cancelable\">Cancelable</a></dt><dd><p>调用方请求停止异步操作。</p>\n</dd>\n<dt>Timeout <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io.Timeout.Error\">Error</a></dt><dd></dd>\n</dl>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Io.Semaphore.waitUncancelable\"><h3><code>std.Io.Semaphore.waitUncancelable</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L52\">第 52 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>阻塞直到有可用的 <code>permit</code>，然后消耗一个。</p>\n<p>另见：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore.wait\">wait</a></code></li>\n<li><code><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore.waitTimeout\">waitTimeout</a></code></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">waitUncancelable</span>(s: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore\">Semaphore</a>, io: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>s: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore\">Semaphore</a></code></pre>\n<pre><code>io: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h4>用法示例</h4><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> waitUncancelable {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> io = <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing\">testing</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.io\">io</a>;\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Context = <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span> {\n        sem: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Semaphore/#std.Io.Semaphore\">Semaphore</a> = .{ .permits = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span> },\n        n: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>,\n\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">worker</span>(ctx: *<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@This</span>()) !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n            ctx.sem.waitUncancelable(io);\n            ctx.n += <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n            ctx.sem.post(io);\n        }\n    };\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> ctx: Context = .{};\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> group: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io.Group\">Group</a> = .init;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">defer</span> group.cancel(io);\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> num_workers = <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> (<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..num_workers) |_| group.async(io, Context.worker, .{&amp;ctx});\n\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> group.await(io);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing\">testing</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/testing/#std.testing.expectEqual\">expectEqual</a>(num_workers, ctx.n);\n}</code></pre>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Io.Semaphore.worker\"><h3><code>std.Io.Semaphore.worker</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L76\">第 76 行</a></p>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">worker</span>(ctx: *<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@This</span>()) !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>ctx: *<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@This</span>()</code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Io.Semaphore.worker--L103\"><h3><code>std.Io.Semaphore.worker</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L103\">第 103 行</a></p>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">worker</span>(ctx: *<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@This</span>()) !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>ctx: *<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@This</span>()</code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Io.Semaphore.worker--L141\"><h3><code>std.Io.Semaphore.worker</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L141\">第 141 行</a></p>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">worker</span>(ctx: *<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@This</span>()) !<span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n